    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to each student’s pace and style. They can explain concepts in simple terms, generate practice problems, and offer instant feedback. This helps students grasp tough ideas without fear, especially in diverse classrooms where teachers have limited time."
